## Game 
Arcade Space Shooter - A friendly vanilla JavaScript 2D game for the web (the "Game")

### Ownership / Attribution:
  The Game is authored and owned by Nishanth Kottapalli ("Owner"),
  developed under nishanthkottapalli.com as Arcade Space Shooter based on the Baryogeneis Simulator developed at TF-141 Labs.

### Scope:
  This repository, including all source code, game architecture, runtime systems,
  tooling, documentation, examples, templates, demos, shaders, UI systems,
  data formats, build scripts, and any bundled assets (collectively, the "Software"),
